    "The discipline matches the rest of our San Diego County routes: OEM parts, written estimates, calibration instead of replacement talk for gas ranges, honest sealed-system verdicts on aging built-ins. The acreage side of town gets the extra glance at outbuilding refrigeration while the truck is parked."
